The boundaries in this package are adapted from:

  Indonesia - Subnational Administrative Boundaries (COD-AB), version 01
  Badan Pusat Statistik (BPS - Statistics Indonesia), OCHA Regional Office for Asia and the Pacific (ROAP)
  https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-idn

licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 IGO licence (CC BY 3.0 IGO):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/igo/legalcode

Changes: units paired with Kemendagri No. 300.2.2-2430 Tahun 2025 kode and names, provinsi dissolved from
kabupaten/kota, lakes and other non-region units removed, geometry simplified and converted to TopoJSON, GeoJSON
and SVG by pipeline/geo.ts in https://github.com/cuikww/nusawilayah.

This package is distributed under the same licence, CC BY 3.0 IGO. When you show these boundaries, credit:
"Batas wilayah: BPS (2020) via HDX, CC BY 3.0 IGO". <PetaIndonesia> shows this line under every map.

Neither BPS nor OCHA endorses this package or its use. Boundaries are illustrative, not legal boundaries;
official boundaries are set by Kemendagri and Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG).
